There certainly seems to be many talented people who in addtion to the
DevTeam can conceive and implement changes in Nethack. One of the
reasons I enjoy playing so much is because there is so much depth to
the game play and interactions in the game.

A wiki could help both those of us who desire to make effective
changes in the game we enjoy playing so much and to those would like
to share what they have learned.

r.g.r.n is a great place to find answers to questions, but what about
tutorials and pedantic information. A wiki could relieve those that
know something from having to know everything and have time to write
it all out. It could be an information base that grows in much the
manner Nethack itself grew.

I have created an experimental wiki and populated it with some sample
pages. If you would like a look the address is:
http://www.seedwiki.com/page.cfm?doc=Nethack%20Source&wikiid=3577

